---
// src/components/AboutSection.astro — Pure HTML statis, Googlebot bisa baca
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="min-h-screen flex items-center px-6 md:px-12 py-24"
  style="background: linear-gradient(160deg,#ffffff 0%,#f8fafc 45%,#f0f9ff 100%);"
  aria-labelledby="about-heading"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 md:gap-16">

    <!-- Image + Stats -->
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-100 to-violet-100 opacity-60"></div>
        <img
          src="/about.png"
          alt="Maulana Nur Anfajm, software engineer dan mahasiswa Universitas Gunadarma, sedang bekerja"
          class="relative w-64 md:w-72 rounded-2xl shadow-xl object-cover ring-4 ring-white"
          width="288"
          height="360"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 w-full">
        {[
          { value: "7",   label: "Semester" },
          { value: "3",   label: "Proyek"   },
          { value: "2",   label: "Artikel"  },
        ].map(s => (
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl px-3 py-3 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-900/5">
            <span class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">{s.value}</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium mt-0.5">{s.label}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-center md:text-left">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-slate-400 uppercase mb-2">Profil</p>
        <h2 id="about-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
          Tentang Saya
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg">
        Saya <strong class="text-slate-900">Maulana Nur Anfajm</strong>, Software Engineer dan mahasiswa
        Sistem Informasi semester 7 di Universitas Gunadarma, Jakarta. Saya membangun aplikasi web
        dari tampilan, REST API, sampai database, memakai React, TypeScript, Go, dan PostgreSQL.
      </p>

      <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
        Ketiga proyek saya sudah berjalan di server: dua di AWS EC2 dengan Docker, satu di Vercel.
        Kode backend saya pisahkan per lapisan (handler, service, repository) supaya mudah dibaca dan diubah.
      </p>

      <ul class="grid gap-3 text-left">
        {[
          { title: "Frontend", desc: "Tampilan responsif dengan React, TypeScript, dan Tailwind CSS.",
            d: "M3 5h18v12H3zM8 21h8M12 17v4" },
          { title: "Backend & Database", desc: "REST API dengan Go (Fiber dan Gin) dan tabel relasional di PostgreSQL.",
            d: "M4 6c0-1.7 3.6-3 8-3s8 1.3 8 3-3.6 3-8 3-8-1.3-8-3zm0 0v12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V6M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3" },
          { title: "Rilis ke Server", desc: "Aplikasi dikemas dalam container Docker lalu dijalankan di AWS EC2.",
            d: "M12 3v12m0-12-4 4m4-4 4 4M5 21h14" },
        ].map(h => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-900/5">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white grid place-items-center shadow-md shadow-slate-900/20">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d={h.d} /></svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 text-sm">{h.title}</p>
              <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-0.5">{h.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
